# NOTICE — crypt4gh fork

This directory is a fork of **crypt4gh 0.4.1** from
[EGA-archive/crypt4gh-rust](https://github.com/EGA-archive/crypt4gh-rust).
The Apache-2.0 text in `LICENSE` is the upstream license text and is unchanged.

## Upstream statements found in this tree

No `Copyright` line was present in `src/*.rs` or in `tests/*.rs`.
The Apache appendix in `LICENSE` is the unfilled template
`Copyright [yyyy] [name of copyright owner]`.

Statements that were present:

- `Cargo.toml` and `Cargo.toml.orig`: `authors = ["Roberto <roberto.ariosa@crg.eu>"]`
- `docs/book.toml`: `authors = ["EGA-CRG System Developers"]`
- `license = "Apache-2.0"`
- `repository = "https://github.com/EGA-archive/crypt4gh-rust"`

## Modifications

Synaptic Four replaced the unmaintained `rust-crypto` dependency with
RustCrypto crates (`aes`, `ctr`, `cbc`, `scrypt`, `bcrypt-pbkdf`).
Those modifications are Apache-2.0.

